      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 46-year-old Caucasian female with a history of epilepsy came into our family medicine center complaining of weakness, fatigue, and arthralgia that made it difficult for her to walk. She'd had these symptoms for 6 months and reported having amenorrhea and hot flashes for the past 2 years."},
